* Code changes
    * Remove all string checks
        * Instead using prepared statments for SQL and returning raw strings to client.
        * Client is now in charge of escaping html characters.
        * Allows all unicode characters to be used for foreign names
        * Json still encoded and decoded server side
    * Update bearer token extraction
        * Now case-insensitive
        * Allow for extra whitespace
    * Fixed inconsistencies in implimentations in api.go
        * handleGetAll now uses sendJSONResponse function instead of manual sending
        * handleRemoveKey uses checkAuth function instead of manual check
    * Change sqlite library
        * Change sqlite library to modernc.org/sqlite
        * No longer requires CGO
    * Add UID bounds check
    * Add points bounds check
        * When adding points, ensures resulting sum will be in bounds
    * Point UID and Points validation helper
        * Added validateAndGetUID helper function to reduce code duplication
            * Now used in handleGetUID, handleAddPoints, and handleRemoveUser
        * Added validateAndGetPoints helper function to reduce code duplication
            * Now used in handleAddPoints and handleSetPoints
    * Minimized lifetime of raw API key in memory
        * API key hashed immediately upon receipt
        * API key in request header zeroed after hashing
    * Audit logs now use hashed API key instead of raw key
    * DBAuthKeyExists now returns hashed key for use in other DB functions
    * DB functions updated to only accept hashed API key
        * DBAddKey
        * DBRemoveKey
        * DBCheckAuth
    * Hasing algorithm changed to Argon2ID
        * Recommend parameters set to time=1, memory=16MB, threads=1
        * All parameters stored in database with hashed key
        * Parameters set at compile time, variables inside db.go
        * Parameters stored in database with hashed key
        * Hashing used parameters defined in database
            * Program parameters onlt affect new keys
    * Hash and salt size are now configurable
        * Both required to be a multiple of 2 to store correctly in hexidecimal
    * Default limit of 16 hashes computing concurrently
        * Configurable via MaxHashRoutines variable in crypto.go
    * DB schema updated to store Argon2ID parameters with hashed key
    * Migration function for old keys removed
    * Auth key sql row ID's now take lowest available when generating like user UIDs
    * Rate limiter able to whitelist localhost at compile time
    * API endpoints updated to use POST instead of GET
        * GET requests should not have a body, and some clients do not allow it
        * POST requests now used for all endpoints, even those that do not require a body
    * GetUID endpoint now returns proper JSON response with uid field instead of raw int
    * Fixed http respose headers after testing in ZAP
        * Added Content-Security-Policy header
        * Added X-Content-Type-Options header
        * Added X-Frame-Options header
        * Added Referrer-Policy header
        * Added Permissions-Policy header
        * Removed Access-Control-Allow-Origin header
    * Removed CORS options entirely as it was not needed
    * Fully updated client size websites
        * Cli page removed and replaced with a GUI admin panel
        * Both the home page and admin page now handle all escaping client side
    * Update serveFile function to be soly responsible for vetting paths before serving files
        * Resolves symlinks before checks and serving
        * Now takes a boolean for whether to ensure the path is in the www folder
        

* Build environment changes
    * Updated mage.go build file
        * New build targets
            * build (default): Build standard binary, defaulting to current OS/Arch unless GOOS/GOARCH env vars set
            * all: Build all supported platforms
            * release: Build all supported platforms and zip each with www/ folder, must provide release version string
            * clean: Remove build/ folder
    * Updated Dockerfile
        * No longer requires CGO
        * www folder now read only
        * Resulting container ~6MB smaller
    * Removed old C version files
    * Removed Tools folder in favor of better endpoint documentation for curl
    * Removed security.md, misunderstood use for it


